   "xml_name": "L07_044_Running Totals",
   "display_name": "Running Totals",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>The last questions put several ideas together, with less help. Think first about <b>which list tools</b> you need (a new list with <code>append</code>? <code>in</code>? <code>sorted</code>? a slice?), and test your function on small examples, including an <b>empty list</b> and a list with <b>one item</b>.</p>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> write the function <code>running_totals(L)</code>, which returns a new list of the same length as the list of integers <code>L</code>, where each item is the sum of the items of <code>L</code> <b>up to and including</b> that position. An empty list gives an empty list.</p>\n<p>For example, <code>running_totals([3, 1, 4, 1])</code> returns <code>[3, 4, 8, 9]</code> (3, 3+1, 3+1+4, 3+1+4+1).</p>",
   "answerpreload": "# Define running_totals(L).\n\n\n\n# ---- Use this space to test your function; comment it out before Check ----\n# print(running_totals([3, 1, 4, 1]))\n",
   "mark": 1.0,
   "tests": [
    {
     "testcode": "print(running_totals([3, 1, 4, 1]))",
     "stdin": "",
     "expected": "[3, 4, 8, 9]",
     "extra": "",
     "show": true,
     "example": true,
     "in_precheck": true,
     "in_check": true
    },
    {
     "testcode": "print(running_totals([]))",
     "stdin": "",
     "expected": "[]",
     "extra": "",
     "show": true,
     "example": true,
     "in_precheck": false,
     "in_check": true
    },
    {
     "testcode": "print(running_totals([-2]))",
     "stdin": "",
     "expected": "[-2]",
     "extra": "",
     "show": true,
     "example": true,
     "in_precheck": false,
     "in_check": true
    },
    {
     "testcode": "L = list(map(int, input().split()))\nprint(running_totals(L))",
     "stdin": "1 1 1 1 1",
     "expected": "[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]",
     "extra": "",
     "show": false,
     "example": false,
     "in_precheck": false,
     "in_check": true
    },
    {
     "testcode": "L = list(map(int, input().split()))\nprint(running_totals(L))",
     "stdin": "10 -10 5 -5",
     "expected": "[10, 0, 5, 0]",
     "extra": "",
     "show": false,
     "example": false,
     "in_precheck": false,
